      "description": "The line code in its cord colour; dark ink on yellow and white cords.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-codes\"><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#C8321E\">HRM</span><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#2F7D4F\">FAM</span><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#2C5AA0\">CLP</span><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#D9B23A;color:#17140F\">MTG</span><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#E6E0CE;color:#17140F\">SAV</span><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#7A4FA0\">N8N</span><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#D9762B\">ORG</span><span class=\"ds-code\" style=\"background:#23807F\">TEA</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-codes{display:flex;gap:8px;background:#16130F;padding:12px}.ds-code{font-family:\"Saira Condensed\",sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#F7F4EA;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:3px}"
